# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a fashion designer, it is essential to consider sustainable practices when creating garments. This research plan outlines the steps I will take to investigate and implement sustainable methods in my design process.<br>
<br>
## Objectives<br>
<br>
* Identify key areas for improvement in current production processes<br>
* Research and evaluate eco-friendly materials and manufacturing techniques<br>
* Develop a sustainable production method that balances quality, cost, and environmental impact<br>
<br>
## Methods<br>
<br>
* Conduct online research on sustainable fashion practices and technologies<br>
* Consult with industry experts and professionals in related fields<br>
* Analyze case studies of successful sustainable fashion initiatives<br>
<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
<br>
* A comprehensive understanding of sustainable fashion practices and their applications<br>
* Development of a customized production method that incorporates eco-friendly materials and manufacturing techniques<br>
* Implementation of the new production method, resulting in reduced environmental impact and improved product quality<br>
